 {
  "title": "Malaga All-in-One Vanity Package with Stone Top",
  "descriptionHtml": "<p>Everything for a finished vanity in one box: the Malaga wall hung vanity, a 20mm polished stone top, an above-counter basin, a chrome tall basin mixer and a pop-up waste. 750, 900 and 1200mm have one basin; 1500 and 1800mm have two basins, two mixers and two wastes.</p><ul><li>Vanity: Malaga wall hung cabinet with finger-pull doors and drawers, 630mm high, 455mm deep</li><li>Stone top: 20mm polished, in White Burst or Blanco Bliss</li><li>Basin: gloss white above-counter basin, rectangular or round</li><li>Tapware: chrome tall basin mixer and chrome pop-up waste</li><li>Sizes: 750, 900 and 1200mm (single basin), 1500 and 1800mm (double basin)</li><li>Colours: Matt White, Antico Oak melamine, Dark Oak melamine</li></ul><p>Tell us your stone colour and basin shape in the order notes at checkout, or we will call to confirm before it is ordered in.</p>",
  "vendor": "Excellent Tiling Services",
